        <p class="cap" id="why-cap">Administration takes 18 per cent of total cost in Sub-Saharan Africa and 3 per cent in Latin America, yet explains almost none of the differences in the gap closed per dollar.<span id="why-more"> They come from how poor the country is and whom the programme pays.</span></p>
